{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54202","headline":"与崔渥登眺江亭赋长韵（题拟） · 濮阳人","name":"与崔渥登眺江亭赋长韵（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"槛外征帆次第行，渔歌偏唱《竹枝》声。\n荷翻水面真珠碎，柳扬湾头绿綫轻。\n峦隐九疑忘去处，泪经千古转分明。\n寥寥日暮云空淡，应爲严妆庙貌清。\n（《灯下闲谈》卷下《湘妃神会》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"濮阳人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54202.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54202","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}